From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:54:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): validate class policy during active quota
 episodes [daveey]

Root: an active quota episode bypassed structural registry admission even after live quota recovery released its hold; final apply silently kept historical selectors on unroutable policy. Remove the structural exemption and refuse late invalid policy instead of retaining profile or legacy pins. Preserve episode deadlines and all transient wall/probe gates.

Proof: unchanged reviewer probe 2 passed / 1 failed; expanded episode/no-episode registry and capability controls plus retained quota files 85 passed. Stable 82-file consumer run 1579 passed / 4 failed; repaired fixtures retain lossless historical rows and correct eligible class construction. Final five whole files passed with retries disabled. Fresh exact-head CI and independent review remain mandatory; fleet remediation/deployment acceptance is not claimed.
